# Applies to `docker build -f worker/Dockerfile.acestep worker/` (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile name>.dockerignore).
# The image gets the package, the licence texts and the build tools only: no tests, no contract job, no caches,
# no virtualenv, no lock for dev deps, no Dockerfiles.
.venv
.venv-contract
.pytest_cache
.coverage
.coverage.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
tests
contract
uv.lock
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.dockerignore
Dockerfile.acestep
Dockerfile.acestep.dockerignore
**/*.env
**/runpod*.env
